## About screen ################################################################
##
## This screen gives credit and copyright information about the game and
## Ren'Py.
##
## There's nothing special about this screen, and hence it also serves as an
## example of how to make a custom screen.

screen about():

    tag menu

    ## This use statement includes the game_menu screen inside this one.
    ## The vbox child is then included inside the viewport inside the
    ## game_menu screen.
    use game_menu(_("About"), scroll="viewport"):

        style_prefix "about"

        vbox:

            label "[config.name!t]"
            text _("Version [config.version!t]\n")

            ## gui.about is usually set in options.rpy.
            if gui.about:
                text "[gui.about!t]\n"

            text "使用 {a=https://www.renpy.org/}Ren'Py{/a} [renpy.version_only] 制作。\n\n本程序包含 MIT、GNU LGPL 等许可的自由软件，完整列表与源码链接见 {a=https://www.renpy.org/}renpy.org{/a}。"


